  "comment": "The Tuning CV inputs are given no family: the knob is marked in octaves, but nothing in the manual, the panel or the plugin states the scaling of the CV input, so it could not be settled whether it tracks 1V per octave. Knob ranges come from the factory presets: microphone distance runs -5 to 5, with -5 the close microphone in Close & dry and 5 the room microphone in Full on, and pan is bipolar about zero. The five factory presets all assign an instrument to every one of the ten voices, so a newly added module already has a kit; no sample has to be loaded before it will sound. Drummer has no embedded preset at all, which matches its phrases starting empty."
